API base URL: http://localhost:3001/api
Frontend URL: http://localhost:3000
The frontend NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL overrides the API base URL.
NestJS global prefix: /api

Authentication
POST /api/auth/login
POST /api/auth/register
POST /api/auth/logout
GET /api/auth/profile
PATCH /api/auth/profile

Dashboard (admin/staff)
GET /api/dashboard/summary

Rooms (admin/staff)
GET /api/rooms
GET /api/rooms/:id
POST /api/rooms
PATCH /api/rooms/:id
DELETE /api/rooms/:id

Tenants (admin/staff; tenant self-service marked separately)
GET /api/tenants
GET /api/tenants/:id
POST /api/tenants
PATCH /api/tenants/:id
DELETE /api/tenants/:id
GET /api/tenants/me (tenant)

Assignments (admin/staff)
GET /api/assignments
POST /api/assignments
PATCH /api/assignments/:id/terminate

Invitations
Admin UI route /invitations calls backend API /api/room-invitations.
GET /api/room-invitations (admin/staff)
POST /api/room-invitations (admin/staff)
GET /api/room-invitations/:code (public, read-only status lookup; returns only invitation and room display details)
POST /api/room-invitations/:code/accept (tenant)
POST /api/room-invitations/:code/reject (tenant)
POST /api/room-invitations/:id/revoke (admin/staff)

Payments
GET /api/payments (admin/staff)
POST /api/payments (admin/staff; creates an unpaid bill)
PATCH /api/payments/:id (admin/staff; edits bill details, payment status is controlled by proof verification)
GET /api/payments/me (tenant)
GET /api/payments/submissions (admin/staff; verification queue with tenant, payment, and audit details)
POST /api/payments/:paymentId/submissions (tenant; multipart fields amount, paymentMethod, paymentDate, referenceNumber, and proof; JPG/JPEG, PNG, WEBP, or PDF up to 5 MB)
GET /api/payments/submissions/:submissionId/proof (tenant owner or admin/staff; authenticated receipt download/preview)
PATCH /api/payments/submissions/:submissionId/verify (admin/staff; status APPROVED or REJECTED, with remarks required for rejection)

Payment submissions remain pending until an authorized reviewer acts. Approval updates the verified amount and payment status; rejection preserves history and allows a new submission. Receipt bytes are stored in PostgreSQL and are never included in list responses.

Maintenance
GET /api/maintenance (admin/staff)
POST /api/maintenance (admin/staff)
GET /api/maintenance/me (tenant; only the authenticated tenant's private requests)
POST /api/maintenance/me (tenant; creates a private PENDING request for the active room)
GET /api/maintenance/public (authenticated tenants; approved announcements only, without tenant or room identifiers)
PATCH /api/maintenance/:id/approve (admin/staff; approves and publishes safe announcement fields)
PATCH /api/maintenance/:id/reject (admin/staff; rejects privately)
PATCH /api/maintenance/:id (admin/staff; updates approved announcement text/location or progress status)
Maintenance statuses: PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, IN_PROGRESS, RESOLVED (displayed as Completed), CANCELLED.
Approval status changes are stored in MaintenanceStatusHistory.

Notifications
No notification routes are implemented yet.

Tenant creation requires fullName, email, and a password of at least 8 characters.
Tenant deletion permanently removes the account and its linked assignments,
payments, maintenance requests, and room invitations. Payment records can be
printed from a payment's Details dialog.

